/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1045263A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </nplcit> <nplcit status="new"><text>UETSUKA H. ET AL.: 'Wavelength Division Multi/Demultiplexer with Arrayed Waveguide Grating' IEICE TRANS. ELECTRON vol. E80-C, no. 5, May 1997, pages 619 - 624, XP000740556</text> <sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUKAWA ELECTRIC CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME NAOKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOSHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME, NAOKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOSHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>THE FURUKAWA ELECTRIC CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME NAOKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOSHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIZUME, NAOKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOSHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAJIMA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An array waveguide diffraction grating optical multiplexer/demultiplexer comprises an input waveguide, an input-side slab waveguide, an array waveguide diffraction grating, an output-side slab waveguide, and an output waveguide. At the coupling part where the end of the input waveguide and the input-side slab waveguide are coupled, the end of the input waveguide is tapered toward the input-side slab waveguide in the direction of the waveguide width. Two mutually-independent narrow waveguide parts are provided along the extensions of the tapers and spaced from each other, and a wide waveguide part is spaced from the narrow waveguide parts.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un multiplexeur/démultiplexeur optique à réseau de diffraction à guide d'ondes en réseau comprend un guide d'ondes d'entrée, un guide d'ondes à plaque latérale d'entrée, un réseau de diffraction, un guide d'ondes en réseau, un guide d'ondes à plaque latérale de sortie, et un guide d'ondes de sortie. Au niveau de la pièce de couplage où l'extrémité du guide d'ondes d'entrée et le guide d'ondes à plaque latérale d'entrée sont couplés, l'extrémité du guide d'ondes d'entrée est conique vers le guide d'ondes à plaque latérale d'entrée dans le sens de la largeur du guide d'ondes. Deux parties de guide d'ondes étroites mutuellement indépendantes sont disposées le long des extensions des cônes et espacées l'une de l'autre, et une partie de guide d'ondes large est espacée des parties de guide d'ondes étroites.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>